                    "languageId": "19",
                    "nativeName": "English",
                    "englishName": "English",
                    "title": "Warning ",
                    "content": "<p><strong>Warning:</strong> If you are worried about anything you hear in the “Hep B Story” go to the clinic to see the Doctor.</p><p><em>This story may contain voices of Aboriginal people who have passed away</em></p><p><em>Hepatitis means inflammation of the liver.&nbsp; Hepa=liver, titis=inflammation.&nbsp; It can be caused by many things</em></p><p><em>This story is about Hepatitis B.&nbsp; It is a worldwide problem that can affect anyone.</em></p>",
